data: {"id": "0673faadc4384ab6-thinking-parallel_evidence-1092", "run_id": "0673faadc4384ab6", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "# 首轮可观测性结果对比\n\n**Metrics (prometheus):**\n- `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = 1, reason=\"ContainerCreating\" → 确认当前仍处于 ContainerCreating 等待状态\n- `kube_pod_status_phase` = 1 for Pending → 与 ContainerCreating 一致\n- `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` = 0 → 尚未启动过容器，无重启\n\n**Logging (elasticsearch):**\n- coverage=empty → 容器从未启动，无业务日志，符合预期\n\n**Tracing (deepflow+tempo):**\n- pod_ip is empty → 沙箱未创建成功，无 IP 分配，无流量/span 数据，符合预期\n\n---\n\n现在我需要执行计划中的 Kubernetes 工具来进一步诊断根因。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789050125145, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

